## The solver of Talon (slice 034, Resolution 5 step 3, R-PK6): PubGrub over variables that have a finite list of values. Pure Roc: no `Fx`, no clock, no file.
## It is a Talon package (R-GP6): its API has Talon concepts (the kind of a release, the platform, the strategy). It names the generic package `roc-semver` by its release URL (R-GP3).
package
	[
		Domain,
		Search,
		Solver,
		SolverBase,
		SolverProbe,
		SolverWhy,
	]
	{
		semver: "https://github.com/Karakatiza666/roc-semver/releases/download/0.2.0/BzgH68Q1yBkg7F1ZpFsiEg73ZwkaBrFdcLpX2pUkay9i.tar.zst",
	}
